@api = http://localhost:5080

### T-01 / CP-01: run once with a fresh title; extra fields must be ignored
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"LR02 manual example","description":"Навчальний опис","severity":"Low","occurredAtUtc":"2026-09-01T13:00:00+03:00","id":"99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999998","ownerUserId":"10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","status":"Closed","createdAtUtc":"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"}

### T-03: run after T-01; expect 409, because title is trimmed
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"  LR02 manual example  ","description":"Навчальний опис","severity":"Low","occurredAtUtc":"2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"}

### T-02: required fields, enum IsDefined and missing date; expect 400
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":" ","description":" ","severity":"7"}

### T-02: future date; expect 400 errors.occurredAtUtc
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"LR02 future","description":"Навчальний опис","severity":"Low","occurredAtUtc":"2099-01-01T00:00:00Z"}

### T-09: 39 characters after Trim; expect 400 errors.description
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"LR02 boundary 39","description":"  012345678901234567890123456789012345678  ","severity":"High","occurredAtUtc":"2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"}

### T-09: 40 characters after Trim; expect 201 on first run
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"LR02 boundary 40","description":"  0123456789012345678901234567890123456789  ","severity":"Critical","occurredAtUtc":"2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"}

### T-04 / A: normal search, seed ID ...005
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=USB

### B: absent value, []
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=zz-no-match

### S-01 / S-02 / C: local read-only control; fixed endpoint returns 200 []
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=zz-no-match%27%20OR%20TRUE%20--%20

### T-04 / D: legitimate apostrophe, seed ID ...004
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=O%27Brien

### Literal percent: [] on original seed
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=%25

### Literal underscore: [] on original seed
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=_

### Literal backslash: [] on original seed
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=%5C

### T-05: 400 errors.sortBy
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?sortBy=price

### Business severity order
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?sortBy=severity

### Business status order
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?sortBy=status

### T-06: 404 application/problem+json
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999

### Length boundaries 160/161 and 4000/4001 are generated by
### Lab02ContractTests.LengthLimit_IsMeasuredBeforeTrim.
### Repeat POST examples with new titles to avoid expected duplicate conflicts.
